% FIX KAOBOOK CAPTION RECURSION BUG
%========================================================================================
% The kao.sty redefines \caption inside figure/table environments using
% \AtBeginEnvironment (via etoolbox), which can cause infinite recursion with
% certain package combinations (tcolorbox + floatrow).
%
% Solution: The simplest workaround is to use \captionof{figure/table}{...}
% inside a center environment instead of wrapping in \begin{figure}...\end{figure}.
% See the dissertation files for examples.
%
% Alternative fix that works: Clear the etoolbox hooks after they're set.
\AtEndPreamble{%
    \patchcmd{\figure}{\begin@float}{\togglefalse{kaocaption}\begin@float}{}{}%
    \patchcmd{\table}{\begin@float}{\togglefalse{kaocaption}\begin@float}{}{}%
}

